{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_title", "source_sha256": "2fa65fadb97fbd81e22e07a02ff25b8766275b2a22ce788548e559d375faede8", "ja": "こちら、方針決まり次第、追加で依頼いたします。", "zh": "这边会在方针确定后，再追加委托。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2fa65fadb97fbd81e22e07a02ff25b8766275b2a22ce788548e559d375faede8", "ja": "こちら、方針決まり次第、追加で依頼いたします。", "zh": "这边会在方针确定后，再追加委托。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1484c1060726499a72937f388991d427d5cf6ababa8888a03e18570c58e82b16", "ja": "（次の劇場定期公演、センターは誰にしようか。\n候補は何人かいるが、そうだな。そろそろ……）", "zh": "（下次的剧场定期公演，要选谁担任Center呢？\n候选名单上有好几个人，不过嘛，也是时候该……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "a662e3e85bb9dd8e245aeea59b4baa053b6d1a67f3db810845d1573a78111efd", "ja": "おおっと、ウワサしてたら、ご本人登場～！\nついに茜ちゃんをセンターに選びに来たんだね！", "zh": "哎呀呀，才刚提到，本人就登场了～！\n你终于来找小茜当Center了对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "ede41488c7cb3c36c5d9ff93a1e05ba737b456381dd4e425a27c684b9e383326", "ja": "わかってた、茜ちゃんにはわかってたよ！　さあさあ、\n遠慮なく発表したまえ！　さあさあさあ……わっ！", "zh": "小茜明白，这一切小茜都明白！\n快快，不用客气，快发表吧！快快快……哇！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1003_se", "source_sha256": "c1e5596fcb588f3202b944b17bfbd8d107bd1ff9f46a134fbfb6bf7a1858dbef", "ja": "どがしゃーん！！", "zh": "（大摔一跤）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1004_p", "source_sha256": "664db8972235b7e31d594529ca181883af95927b031bba5f3b56bcb91dffb3cd", "ja": "はっ！　だ、大丈夫か、茜？", "zh": "啊！没、没事吧，茜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "2bfd841df6f5bf13e5a160ef046b10798f9ef72fb8746862f9fd8caab5d84618", "ja": "うう、大丈夫だけど、ちょっとおしり\n打ったよ……い、痛い……。", "zh": "呜呜，是没什么，\n就是撞到屁股了……好、好痛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "4da899956d0a5ba1514f36319901f119b8ce27d05af1fa1e3bdd7d37e3484bea", "ja": "ちょっと茜ちゃん休憩するね……。しょうがない、\n今回のセンターは、しほりんに任せた！", "zh": "小茜去休息一下……没办法了，\n这次的Center，就交给志保保吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "15dc6f0a52a01c47072f1b52e181ab3018cd9678c2157814f08ee1c439de73c3", "ja": "なっ。……急に何を言いだすんですか？", "zh": "什么……你突然胡说什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1008_p", "source_sha256": "efe0f40be6938ee1c7ca507a7387ff7e5c5e676883598ac20cb42fd2bca3d009", "ja": "志保がセンター……。そうだな！", "zh": "志保担任Center……对耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "8fd6f6e9d1fe629ee8767779017d818433d5a47c82681b7697283b707e7c4de7", "ja": "{$P$}さんまで！　そんな大事な\nことを適当に決めるなんて、不真面目です。", "zh": "连{$P$}先生都这样！\n随便决定这么重要的事，太不正经了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "c55c5f173825778097f5eb1bc27f0c3f86ca9e3bffc802911be7f3d84a85efa7", "ja": "今日も元気にレッスンレッスン～♪\n猪突も～しん♪　も～も～しん♪", "zh": "今天也活力十足训练训练～♪\n向前～冲♪冲～冲～冲♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "6fe6a1541c1ac4f40d552f2b0384a4094da229a8171ca16b09557ec9bbc02865", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん達、こんにちは！\nみんなでなんの話をしてるんですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，你们好！\n大家在聊什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1012_p", "source_sha256": "fc1029de0768753c03ba5080bc883eac03596e6b652c459c1b4c0703bae531db", "ja": "ああ、次の公演のセンターを\n志保にお願いしてたんだ。", "zh": "嗯，我正在拜托志保担任\n下次公演的Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "42bba5377d0c2733c59ee5174616c03c3bd1e34a1ba5860b2c6505f8caa427a1", "ja": "志保ちゃんがセンター！　すごいすご～い！\nおめでとう、志保ちゃん♪", "zh": "志保要当Center！好厉害好厉害～！\n恭喜你，志保♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0f3bc12e7fb27b294ff35abe2754d8a913ca232a8e71b82416f8c79c6b0439f2", "ja": "志保、やってくれるか？　言っておくが、適当に決めた\nんじゃないぞ。元々、そろそろ志保にと思ってたんだ。", "zh": "志保，你愿意吗？我要先声明，这不是随便决定的。\n我原本就在想差不多该由志保担任了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "bc3c7ae18acb8fca097f0a1ddd355f877c67d114d4441d743abafc78a2c66832", "ja": "そうだよ、茜ちゃんがおしりを打ったことが\n{$P$}ちゃんの心を動かしたんだよ？", "zh": "对啊，因为小茜撞到屁股，\n才打动了小{$P$}的心对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1016_p", "source_sha256": "cff85146032b9342043f0780ffd2836b5c07fde13359ed8cc17b7f7dfda8fb82", "ja": "いや、それは関係ないが。", "zh": "不，跟这没有关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "a4adf133724a467f4d8a3b25c7495aea6da78b0a56f9d10ab8b8cd64d35ba7ea", "ja": "そ、そうですか。{$P$}さんが\nちゃんと考えてくれたのなら……。", "zh": "原、原来是这样啊。既然{$P$}先生\n是经过深思熟虑才这么说的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "c36896f87fdc30bfeb9577a1232f56fd74ea508f1f6905bac18da328aa8409e5", "ja": "わかりました。よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "我知道了，请你多多指教。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "22ba4e33da1236f6bed78edff3fbcee25d138666f894af54af3e874f1470684b", "ja": "やったー！　一緒に頑張ろうね！！\n志保ちゃんを～♪　全力でサポートするぞ～♪　おー！", "zh": "太好了──！一起加油吧！！\n我要全力支援～♪志保～♪喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "2022b4f82ebc90afdcb9ca1cc9b933e451eecde898a29a6271ba86967a056739", "ja": "別にサポートなんて必要ないわ。\n矢吹さんは自分のレッスンに集中して。", "zh": "我不用什么支援。\n矢吹请专注在自己的训练课程上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "cac6a8af50ae67571ea06ba713882555af074357e42b441618a381f149699826", "ja": "おしりは、ちょっと打っただけだから、\n茜ちゃんも、すぐ復活するから安心してね！", "zh": "人家只是屁股稍微撞了一下，\n小茜也会马上复活的，请放心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "c3c507a8265154acbf911d07e183d4d9cc2ac1288c936a48ee91da807d0257de", "ja": "しほりん、ついてるよ！　劇場の最終兵器アイドル、\n茜ちゃんと一緒にレッスンできるなんて～！", "zh": "志保保，你真走运！\n居然能跟剧场的最终兵器偶像──小茜一起训练～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1023_033sih", "source_sha256": "f8100cb87bb4d3589948c3472e73229897977b96c9736396fda20f95afc3055d", "ja": "いえ、私はひとりで練習します。\n……今まで以上に、集中してやらなきゃならないし。", "zh": "不用，我自己练习就好。\n……现在我得比以往更专注才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "6121ae63987d4b2f87ef68a1aa889186722140c4576d265750d15f25e26a55e3", "ja": "それでは、失礼します。", "zh": "那我先失陪了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1025_036kan", "source_sha256": "d95715e3bc2d20343ae6966e25abc6334a434e122e580de696f5017c69457b67", "ja": "志保ちゃん……。", "zh": "志保……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "2e1b14360c0675602ae47a0355ea696c824bb9c6b6622aeb6023e81810662c90", "ja": "ん～、しほりんは、恥ずかしがり屋さんだね！", "zh": "嗯～志保保真是害羞宝宝呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_015_1027_p", "source_sha256": "c71c65a269bdc1f74c245feff2f8cb37ef576f6c65ecfcc66d3788a8e2b6aa13", "ja": "（志保は、ひとりきりでレッスンをするつもりか。\n……少し様子を見てみるかな）", "zh": "（志保是打算自己一个人练习吗？\n……我稍微观察一下状况吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
